{"version":1,"content":"<p>本港地區明日（19日，周一）天氣預測：大致天晴，明早最低氣溫約27°C，日間乾燥及炎熱，市區最高氣溫約32°C，新界再高一兩度。</p><p>吹和緩偏東風，初時高地風勢間中清勁。</p><p>展望隨後數日大致天晴及乾燥。</p><p>周三日間酷熱。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T12:58:51.098524+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:02:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T03:17:33.472410+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T12:57:36.955261+00:00","content_hash":"1da52d230341ba19041f467ee4d8e555f5d73d9e3b58feb4d3c9a3a278adca67","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}